===Etymology===
{{inh+|be|zle-ort|ко́шка}}, from {{inh|be|orv|ко́шька}}, from unattested {{m|orv|*ко́чька}}, from {{inh|be|sla-pro|*kòťьka}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*kòťь}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*kòtъ}}. Cognate with {{cog|ru|ко́шка}} and {{cog|uk|кі́шка}}.

