===Noun===
{{be-noun|ко́шка<*.anml>}}

# female [[cat]] {{gl|domesticated species}}
#: {{syn|be|ко́тка}}
#* {{quote-book|be|year=1854|title=[[s:be:Niaczyścik_(1854)/Niaczyścik|Niaczyścik]]|author=w:Alexander Rypinski|location=w:London
|page=12|pageurl=https://be.wikisource.org/wiki/Старонка:Niaczyścik_(1854).pdf/16
|text=Aż tut hlanuć, ażna strach! / '''Koszki''' miāŭkajuć, dziarucca!
|t=The sight is even scary to behold! The '''cats''' are meowing and fighting among themselves!}}
#* {{RQ:be:s|Ірляндзкія Народныя Казкі (1923)|page=36
|Роўна ў поўдзень '''кошка''' выйшла з пячэры. Убачыўшы Амадана, яна гэтак страшна крыкнула, што мора паднялося на чверць мілі ўгару, і запыталася яна ў Амадана, хто ён і адкуль ён узяў сьмеласьць зьявіцца перад яе вачыма.
|origtext=en:When the '''cat''' came out at twelve o’clock and saw the Amadan, she let a roar out of her that drove back the waters of the sea and piled them up a quarter of a mile high, and she asked him who he was and how he had the impudence to come there to meet her.
|t=Precisely at noon the '''cat''' came out of the cave. Upon seeing the Amadan, she let out such a terrifying scream that the sea rose a quarter of a mile high, and she asked the Amadan who he was and how he had the impudence to appear before her eyes.}}
# [[cat]] {{gl|member of the cat family {{taxfmt|Felidae|family}}}}

